      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to the TCPC spec, section 4.4.5.2:\nIf DRP\u003d1b, the only allowed values for CC1/CC2 are Rp/Rp or Rd/Rd.\nCOMMAND.Look4Connection shall do nothing if CC1/CC2 are not Rp/Rp or Rd/Rd.",
